# MoonBite release signing key (minisign public key).
#
# This is a PLACEHOLDER. Until the line below is replaced with a real minisign
# public key, the installers and the bundle builder run in sha256-integrity-only
# mode and print a loud warning: downloads are checked for corruption but NOT
# for authenticity, so a malicious origin swap is not yet detectable.
#
# To activate signing, follow deploy/RELEASE-SIGNING.md:
#   1. On an OFFLINE machine, generate the key:  minisign -G -p moonbite-release.pub -s moonbite-release.key
#   2. Keep moonbite-release.key offline, passphrase-protected. NEVER commit it.
#   3. Paste the generated public key line (starts "RW...") below, replacing REPLACE_ME.
#   4. Publish this same public key on moonbite.org and in the repo README so
#      users can pin it independently of any single origin.
#
# The line below MUST be a single minisign public key (untrusted-comment line
# optional). Everything starting with '#' is ignored by the installers.

REPLACE_ME_WITH_MINISIGN_PUBLIC_KEY
